---
import AppShell from '@/components/AppShell.astro'
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
	title="*.smi | About"
	description="How the SMILES, REINVENT, and Nearest Neighbor viewers work."
>
	<AppShell active="about">
		<section class="max-w-[40rem] pl-4">
			<h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold leading-[52px]">About</h1>
			<p class="mt-1 text-gray-500">
				Paste SMILES or open a file to render 2D molecular structures. Everything runs in the
				frontend, locally in your browser, so files are never uploaded. The site is designed
				to process files up to 20 MB.
			</p>

			<dl class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-gray-500">
				<div>
					<dt class="font-semibold text-black">REINVENT</dt>
					<dd>Browse molecules by step and graph numeric properties from a CSV or TSV output.</dd>
				</div>
				<div>
					<dt class="font-semibold text-black">Nearest Neighbor</dt>
					<dd>Inspect each query, then filter and sort its neighbors by similarity or value.</dd>
				</div>
			</dl>

			<aside class="mt-8 border-l-2 border-accent pl-4 text-gray-500" aria-label="Keyboard shortcut">
				<span class="font-semibold text-black">Shortcut:</span> use the left and right arrow keys
				to move through the active Step or Query slicer.
			</aside>
		</section>
	</AppShell>
</BaseLayout>
